  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Enhancement; <strong>CL</strong> 2nd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> chest; <strong>Price</strong> 1,600 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 2 lbs.</p>\n<p>These linen wraps are covered in arcane marks. Once per day, as a standard action, a creature can activate the staunching wraps to gain a +2 untyped bonus to a saving throw of their choice. This bonus lasts for one round per caster level.</p>\n<p><strong>Flask Shard Effect:</strong> Increase the caster level of this item to the next increment of 5, increase uses per day by 1, and increase the bonus to saving throws by +1. <strong>Flask Shard Limit:</strong> +4</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Enhancement sphere (Staunch Resistance (enhance)); <strong>Cost</strong> 800 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc79\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
